<loader order="1">Item::TrinketSet::LoadMultiple</loader>
<!-- The new trinket sets. Each tier lists every modifier it gives (the lower tiers' too):
     merge-set-bonuses stays off, because the vanilla merge copies the already merged lists
     (a set with three or more tiers would get its lower tiers twice). -->
